<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E gets PLN 160 mln order.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E gets PLN 160 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Mostostal Export SA on Wednesday said it won a tender for a 160 million zloty order to build a sewage treatment plant in the central Polish city of Bydgoszcz.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our offer has now been picked but the (exact) value of the contract will be negotiated in the first days of June,&quot; Wojciech Rzepka, deputy-head of Mostostal Export SA, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
